Y = candles
Ó = light y=6 color=0.62,0.66,0.82 radius=9
D = banner torn
// The houses' roofs of weathered clay tile, each on its building's north-west corner, and each house
// built its own way: Brannoc's forge under a long gable, its door between two windows; Corvane's
// half-timbered house under a single gable; Pell's house an L of two crossing gables; Wren's timbering
// jettied out over its ashlar ground floor, dormers in its roof; Tamsin's stone hall and the watch
// office under hipped roofs; and the neighbourhood's five, gabled and hipped by turns.
À = roof span=7,7 ridge=z top=5.6 pitch=4.4 eave=0.45 tex=clay_tile wall=soot_ashlar on=H
Á = roof span=5,5 ridge=x top=5.6 pitch=3.4 eave=0.45 tex=clay_tile wall=timber on=#
